flowchart TD
    A[User clicks Highlight] --> B{In cache?}
    B -->|yes| C[Local write ~5ms]
    B -->|no| D[Create page record]
    D --> C
    C --> E[Broadcast to UI]
    subgraph reconcile [async reconcile · background]
        F[Upsert page] --> G[Insert note]
        G --> H{Server ack?}
        H -->|ok| I[Mark synced]
        H -->|timeout| J[Queue retry]
        J --> F
    end
    E -.-> F
    I --> K([Done])
